    "sub_name": "企業風險管理",
    "sub_ename": "ENTERPRISE RISK MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹企業風險管理的理論、架構及其應用，使學員具有企業風險管理，尤其是整合性風險管理的相關知識和能力，並瞭解相關領域之最新發展趨勢",
    "describe_eh": "This course provides a rich introduction to the study of business risk management. It allows students to extend their business risk management   knowledge to a specific in-depth knowledge of integration. Students also know the trend of business risk management in the course.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
